# Assets

## allow-extension.js

```js
// allow-extension/lib.js
const shared = "shared";

// allow-extension/main.js
console.log(shared);
import("./dynamic.js");
const unused = 42;

export { shared as t, unused };

```

## dynamic.js

```js
import { t as shared } from "./allow-extension.js";

// allow-extension/dynamic.js
console.log(shared);

```

